      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_15",
        on: "enemies_defeated",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-elvish-glad.webp",
            text: _("Finally, we have retaken the city! Let us rest here, friends."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thief",
            text: _("Victory! The thieves of Elensefar will be in your service, my lord."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("The party rested for three days, after which an old friend returned."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "delfador_store.profile",
            value: "portraits/delfador.webp~RIGHT()",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_16",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_17",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Delfador",
            unit: "Delfador",
            x: 24,
            y: 16,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Kalenz",
            unit: "Kalenz",
            x: 22,
            y: 16,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Greetings, friends. I see that you have rescued the city! I knew that you could do it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-elvish-glad.webp",
            text: _("Delfador! So good to see you! Where have you been?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("I have been meeting with the Ka’lian, the Great Council of the Elves. This is Kalenz, a great lord of the Northern Elves who came to the Council to offer us the support of his people."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Greetings, friend."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Delfador, we have captured this city, but surely Asheviere’s men will come and attack us! What should we do?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("The Ka’lian has met and decided: we must capture the Sceptre of Fire."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("The Sceptre of Fire? What’s that?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mentoring.webp",
            text: _("The Sceptre of Fire is the most ancient artifact of the realm of Wesnoth. It was forged by the dwarves of Knalga at the request of King Haldric II. It took their finest smiths years to make it, but soon after it was completed, the makers were chased underground, attacked by the elves. None know exactly what occurred, but the Sceptre was lost somewhere in the great caverns. Years have passed, and the fortunes of the dwarves have waxed and waned, but the Sceptre has never been found."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("But what has this to do with me?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("When Garard II, your uncle, was deciding upon a successor, he issued an edict that whichever member of the royal family could retrieve the Sceptre of Fire would rule the land."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Oh, and you want me to get this Sceptre?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("We will help you retrieve it, my lord."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Time is short. We think that Asheviere is also searching for the Sceptre, to help seal her place as ruler. But if you find the Sceptre first, the people will support you as the king."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Me? King?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Yes, Konrad. I believe you will be king one day. Now let us make haste!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("We cannot go to Wesmere, for Asheviere’s orcs have the approaches ringed about with steel; Kalenz and I barely escaped, and Chantal cannot get out. Until we are stronger, we must go where the orcs are not."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
